# Playwright MCP artifacts — generated whenever Claude drives the browser
# for verification. Snapshot YAMLs, console logs, screenshots, traces. Not
# meaningful to commit; kept around only for the in-session debugging the
# tool itself uses.
.playwright-mcp/
playwright-report/
test-results/
# Screenshots Claude saves at the repo root via browser_take_screenshot.
# verify-*.png matches the naming convention I've been using; broaden if
# we adopt other prefixes.
verify-*.png
verify-*.jpeg

# Session logs written by /compress for AI recall via /resume. Local-only
# memory; not meaningful to commit. Two earlier files (2026-06-03 and
# 2026-06-10) were committed by accident before this rule existed —
# git-rm --cached from tracking but kept on disk.
System/Session-Logs/
